      "imageWidth": 3780,
      "imageHeight": 2493,
      "story": "Still Life of Fruit, Dead Birds, and a Monkey is a painting by the Dutch artist Clara Peeters, c. 1615-1620. It is a still life, painted in oils on a wooden panel, measuring 47.6 cm × 65.5 cm. The painting is in a private collection.",
